WEBVTT

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:03.730
What is that?

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.260
A robot?

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.860
It's an honor to meet you.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.190
Hey, stop!

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.150
I am the guide to the <i>Petit Hierozoicon</i>,

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.850
and a loyal servant of Yushi-sama...

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.710
The Niyurius Fool.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.240
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.510
Well, um, this is...

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:28.260
It has to do with the dream I 
was going to tell you about.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:33.220
I thought this book was a dream, but it wasn't.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:37.630
Supposedly, it has spirits
sealed inside, and...

00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:39.460
Indeed!

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:43.770
Yushi-sama is the master 
of all twenty-two of us!

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.050
Shut up! Seriously, just be quiet!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.620
So, Yushi-sama, who might this be?

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.350
I said, "Shut up!"

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.100
Calm down, Inaba.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:56.700
Tell me what's going on!

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.730
H-Hase...

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:39.260
<b>Seventh Haunting 
I'm in Training!</b>

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.480
Open up!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.520
This isn't the time!

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:46.060
Or you'll regret it!

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.080
Fool, do you have anyone who could be useful?

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.130
Indeed.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:53.860
How about this one? The Devil, Cerberus!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:58.090
Cerberus, the man-eating wolf of Hell!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:11.270
However, he's still a pup.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.840
He will be grown in another 200 years.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.030
I can't wait that long!

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.230
Then how about him?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.710
The Chariot, Hippogriff!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.830
Hippogriff, the black griffin!

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.720
Steed of the gods, he can travel a 
thousand leagues in an instant.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.950
Yes... We can ride it to safety—

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.790
Huh?

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.270
Well, he is the gods' steed.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:44.550
Thus, he is proud, and you must 
know the trick to riding him.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.260
He's useless!

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.650
Damn it...

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:52.480
What else is there? How about Strength?

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:57.070
Inaba, you said many spirits 
are in here, right?

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.500
Y-Yeah...

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:00.590
So perhaps...

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.950
Inaba, water. A water spirit.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:04.590
Okay.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.460
The Empress, Merower!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:13.380
Merower, the water spirit.

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.600
Okay! Wash them away!

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:20.000
She still has—

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.100
I knew it!

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.980
No, this is good enough.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:32.000
Now you're gonna pay, you bastards!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.790
You can't get away.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.560
Got it, Inaba?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.590
Yeah.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.870
Don't panic.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.210
R-Right.

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:43.610
Thanks to you, our bikes are a mess!

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:44.800
Get ready!

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.420
Now!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.470
The Tower, Ithaqua!

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.810
I-I'm numb.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.610
All right!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.240
Wh-What the hell did you do?

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:06.690
Ithaqua, the thunder spirit.

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.390
The hell did do you do?

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.150
Die, you bastards!

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.090
Stay away!

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.120
Now that you've brought that out,

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:24.000
you're willing to take some risks, right?

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.790
Sh-Shut up!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.570
My arm! My arm!

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.520
And now he's in berserker mode...

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.670
Guess I'll call an ambulance later.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.910
Master... Master!

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:43.730
Yeah?

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:48.620
If you do not recall the Hippogriff, 
he will fly to the world's end.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.150
Oh, right.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.320
Return, Hippogriff!

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.670
I-It came back...

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.420
Indeed.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.690
Hey! Don't just bring it back!

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:09.870
I thought my eardrums would burst!

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.070
They passed out while standing up.

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.430
Poor things!

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:23.560
Well, they've probably learned 
that the world is a big place.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:30.720
But how did you know that water 
and lightning were in the book?

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.090
Of course I knew.

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:36.020
The four elements are a core part of magic.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.630
The four elements?

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:40.300
Fire, water, earth, and wind

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>Fire 

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:43.220
are said to be the elements that 
comprise the natural world.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:47.490
And then, some systems also have 
a fifth element called "ki."

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.870
How did you know that?

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:53.410
You were chosen to be a
master of a magic book,

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.390
but you don't know anything, do you?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:59.040
I can't help it... I didn't want to be.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.760
That's a terrible thing to say.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:03.390
Um, no... There, there.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.360
Oh? This is the place?

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.320
It's a pretty classy apartment building.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:17.030
Yeah. Thanks for everything today.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.700
W-Want to stop in for a bit?

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:28.420
No, it's fine. Not today.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.620
Another time.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:30.910
I see.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:33.790
Bye.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.200
Inaba!

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.150
Next time, tell me everything.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.100
Don't hide anything from me.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.440
Okay.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.060
I'm back.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.980
Welcome home.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.840
I'm back, Hanako-san.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.060
Yushi-kun! Big trouble!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:03.110
The book that Furuhonya-san 
gave me yesterday vanished!

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:05.580
I know I took it to the hospital!

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:10.620
I searched the building and the hospital
 all day, but I can't find it!

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.640
Don't worry.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.850
It's right here.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.260
The <i>Petit Hierozoicon</i>, huh?

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:21.180
I guess stuff like this happens, huh?

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:24.600
I can't believe they chose 
Yushi-kun as their master.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.810
In the sea of eternal time,

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:30.150
they meet at the end of a vast world.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:33.230
It's a miracle, isn't it?

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.390
That's an exaggeration!

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.630
I'm not that special, 
and neither is this book.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.160
I'm just a normal person!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.880
But I do feel fate at work.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:49.220
Do you remember what I said before,

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.660
that you maybe had a knack for this stuff?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:58.820
Come to think of it...

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.480
<i>Fate. Miracles.</i>

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.130
<i>When my parents died,</i>

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:07.990
<i>I didn't believe in any of that.</i>

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:12.640
<i>But when I came to these apartments 
and saw all kinds of truths,</i>

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:15.690
<i>my beliefs started to change.</i>

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:22.490
<i>Fool said he'd been searching 
for a master for a long time.</i>

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:27.470
<i>Over the long years, he must have passed
 from one hand to the next many times.</i>

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.380
<b>Fire 

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.370
<i>Why do I have the right to be 
master to a magic book</i>

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:35.050
<i>over Hase, who knew about the four elements?</i>

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:40.800
<i>Maybe the fact that I was led 
to this apartment building</i>

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.490
<i>gave me that potential?</i>

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:48.300
But what do I do now?

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:50.240
What are you so worried about?

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:52.860
Everyone around you specializes in this stuff.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:55.240
Ask me anything, Yushi-kun.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.320
And you have Fujiyuki-sensei and Ryu-san,

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.150
the best specialists you could want!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:05.750
<b>Weak Yushi-kun</b>

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.920
At this point, it's best that 
you learn some things,

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:05.380
in order to keep you out of ghost trouble.

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:09.330
You can go from ignoring 
it to controlling it.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.330
<b>Yushi-kun Empowered by Knowledge</b>

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:10.260
Right?

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.260
Right.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:14.250
Um, I can't get you to sell this book, can I?

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:15.620
Sure.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:19.520
It was a freebie to begin with, and the 
guys inside are fine with it.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:20.420
Take it.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:21.260
Thanks!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:25.100
Hey, hey... What kinds of spirits are inside?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:26.940
Show us!

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.580
They're really nothing special.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:30.510
Fool.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.680
You called, master?

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:37.110
Hello, everyone!

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:41.380
I am the guide to the <i>Petit Hierozoicon</i>,

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.730
the Niyurius Fool.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:46.280
A pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:48.950
This book's modeled after the tarot, huh?

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.560
Indeed.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.150
Can I call Death?

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:53.690
You're starting with that one?!

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:57.010
It sounded sorta scary, so I 
haven't summoned it!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.960
But it sounds fun!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.040
They're nothing special, right?

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.380
So why not?

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.430
Okay, let's try it.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:08.050
Death, Thanatos.

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:14.020
Thanatos! One of the archangels of death 
who serve the king of the underworld.

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.740
He's kinda tiny, huh?

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:29.580
You will die within three days!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.840
<b>Bunny-chan</b>

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.460
Well, then...

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:40.650
Cheers!

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:41.310
Good luck, Yushi-kun!

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:44.210
You're the ones who wanted to see it!

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:47.300
Thanatos hasn't had any training yet.

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.680
Seeing when someone will 
die would be difficult.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.680
That isn't the issue!

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:54.100
But isn't that great, Yushi-kun?

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.600
You don't have to die.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.770
Have to die?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:01.800
Dealing with monsters and spirits 
takes a fair amount of energy.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.820
To do their work, they inhale 
their master's life energy.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:06.950
Inhale my life energy?

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.370
If this were the full <i>Hierozoicon</i>,

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:14.970
simply summoning one could 
have knocked you flat.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:19.290
I've been giving up my 
life to use this thing?

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.590
So, tomorrow, let's start...

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.810
Training to enhance your spiritual power!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:27.510
We'll use spring break for 
a crash training course!

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:32.260
Oh, take time off work. At first, 
you won't be able to do both.

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:31.770
<i>Spiritual power... Training?</i>

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:35.430
Well, I've gotta go to talk 
to Fujiyuki-sensei!

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.850
See you tomorrow!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.850
Akine-san!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.520
Ah, chirp...

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:39.620
What's going on, chirp?

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.260
Zzz, chirp!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.280
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.780
<i>Everyone's ignoring what I want.</i>

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.860
<i>What's about to start?</i>

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:52.810
<i>I just wanted to lead a 
normal high school life,</i>

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:55.960
<i>and become a normal businessman!</i>

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.870
<i>Something stuck in my pillow?</i>

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.210
So that's where Jin put it?

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.620
What?

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.150
Akine-san?

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:51.040
Good morning! Time for morning training!

00:13:58.490 --> 00:14:01.680
Um, what is this?

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:04.600
Don't worry... You'll get used to it soon.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.460
Hang in there!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:10.400
Chant this sutra, Yushi-kun.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.320
Sutra?

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:15.780
R-Rokei-Rokei-Rokei...

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.480
Takei-Takei-Takei...

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.220
What is this?!

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:21.600
A sutra that enhances your spiritual power.

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.660
For now, focus on chanting it.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.890
<i>R-Rokei-Rokei-Rokei...</i>

00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.300
<i>Rokei-Rokei-Rokei.</i>

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.580
<i>Why do I have to do this?</i>

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:30.590
Rokei-Rokei-Rokei.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:33.590
Rokei-Rokei-Rokei.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:34.500
<i>I want to live in peace!</i>

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.650
Rokei-Rokei-Rokei.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.030
That's enough, Yushi-kun.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:40.720
It's already over?

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:43.570
Yeah. Two hours is plenty.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.600
Two hours? Was I doing it the whole time?

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.770
You sure were.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:51.760
Now go warm up in the bath.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.080
Let's eat breakfast.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:57.440
What's going on here?

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:02.040
It smells so good... I'm so hungry...

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:03.580
Breakfast time!

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.720
Morning.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:08.200
Hanging in there, new mage?

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.450
He gets meat for breakfast?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.520
Aren't monks in training not 
supposed to eat much?

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.590
It's all right. This isn't a religious thing.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:19.030
Endurance is the most fundamental aspect.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:22.270
Yushi-kun needs lots of nutritious food.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.120
It's so good!

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:28.260
I think I understand why 
Akine-san eats so much!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.240
Right?

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.820
It's good to be young, huh?

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.820
They look like they're qualifying 
for a speed-eating contest.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:40.290
I feel so much calmer...

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.540
I was so hungry a while ago, 
I thought I'd die.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:46.200
For your first time, you worked really hard.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.560
It's hard to believe it was two hours.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:53.230
I thought it was five minutes.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:55.840
You were in a trance.

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.220
A trance?

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.700
You were super focused!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.620
Like a state of meditation.

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:05.390
You can go into a trance that easily?

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:07.870
Of course, it depends on the situation.

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:11.400
The sutra you were chanting is 
supposed to have that effect.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:16.080
A state of meditation is 
caused by alpha waves.

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:19.420
For example, the sitar, an Indian instrument,

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:22.410
is said to induce alpha waves in the brain.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:26.080
Once, a guy went to play the sitar.

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:29.110
Next thing he knew, four hours had passed.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:31.140
There are stories like that.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.750
Just like me.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:36.340
The unconscious part of the mind activates.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:39.630
That's where psychic and 
spiritual powers come from.

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:44.380
All right, rest until the next exercise.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.060
We're still doing it?

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.390
We're still doing it!

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:50.950
Bye! Good luck, new kid!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:54.050
I guess I'll clean the front hall.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.870
Kuri...

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.450
You're my only friend!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.160
It feels so good.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.240
Yushi-kun!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.170
We're starting afternoon training.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.030
A dad sleeping with his kid.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:21.130
Or more like a child sleeping 
with a stuffed animal.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:24.430
<i>Only one of those was different!</i>

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:27.020
Now, here's lunch.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.030
Just this?

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.610
For now, this is enough.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.640
<i>But it's good...</i>

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:35.210
<i>Honey butter.</i>

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:36.480
<i>Ruriko-san is great.</i>

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.400
Now, come in.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:43.070
Kneel there.

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:46.950
This is what you'll read now.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.790
I'll read it with you.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.450
Let's get started.

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:55.550
O-Okay.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:18:02.460
<i>Bussetsumakahannyaharamitashingyo.</i>

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:09.600
<i>Kanjizaibosagyojinhannyaharamitaji.</i>

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:16.680
<i>Shokengounkaikutoissaikuyakusharishi.</i>

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:20.110
<i>Shikifuikukufuishikishiki.</i>

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:25.160
<i>Shikisotsuzekukusokuze...</i>

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:37.240
<i>S-Something is coming back inside my head.</i>

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:41.040
<i>This is why lunch was just a piece of toast?</i>

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:44.640
<i>If I'd eaten a full lunch, 
I might have thrown up.</i>

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.260
Okay, that's enough.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:54.500
Great job. It's 5:00 PM.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.310
5:00 PM?!

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:59.570
I skipped five hours... this time?

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.390
Yushi-kun?

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:04.660
M-My body...

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.820
My leg just cramped! Ow!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.810
Stay still. You shouldn't move it.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.650
First, drink this.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.500
Water?

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.430
Yeah. Take your time.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:22.730
I feel alive again!

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:24.800
The water of life, huh?

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.780
Hey, working hard?

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.300
Furuhonya-san...

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.820
Perfect timing.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:31.940
Take Yushi-kun to the bath.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:35.160
You can't stand by yourself, can you?

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:36.310
B-But...

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.640
If you don't want me to do it, 
should I ask Mariko-chan instead?

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:41.490
She'll be very gentle.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:45.650
<i>Okay, Yushi-kun, let's get undressed!</i>

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:46.410
No!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.340
There you go!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.280
I'll get dinner ready, okay?

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.170
Right, Mommy!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.740
Stop holding me like this!

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.260
To keep this show beautiful,

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:59.970
and out of respect for Yushi-kun's dignity,

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:07.850
<b>Please enjoy these birds cleaning their feathers.</b>

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:02.310
we'll skip this next scene, chirp.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:05.930
Please enjoy these birds cleaning 
their feathers, chirp.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.050
Be entranced by my feathers' beauty, chirp.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.240
It's so good!

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.720
Have as much ramen as you like!

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:16.150
<i>And after that,</i>

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:19.170
<i>I trained, ate, and slept.</i>

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.270
<i>Then trained, ate, and slept more.</i>

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:23.620
<i>I spent a whole week doing nothing but that.</i>

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:25.990
<i>I think I'm starting to get 
used to it a little.</i>

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:26.670
<i>But...</i>

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.400
Don't hide anything from me.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.580
<i>I know why this is happening.</i>

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.620
<i>I have homework.</i>

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:39.180
<i>Homework I've been putting off a while.</i>

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:42.760
<i>I haven't been able to tell Hase anything.</i>

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:46.760
<i>Not about this apartment, or my friends,</i>

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.170
<i>or the Petit Hierozoicon.</i>

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.320
<i>I have to tell him.</i>

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.620
<i>But what do I say?</i>

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.020
<i>Will he accept it?</i>

00:20:56.420 --> 00:21:00.030
<i>When I'm supposed to be used to this, 
and I get shocked all the time...</i>

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.770
<i>And is it okay to involve him in this fuss?</i>

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:09.580
Yushi-kun, phone call!

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:11.790
From someone named Hase-kun.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:15.950
Hello?

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:17.530
Oh, Inaba...

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.410
H-Hey.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.540
<i>This is my chance.</i>

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.240
<i>I can tell him. I can tell him everything!</i>

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.430
Um, I...

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.270
I...

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:28.020
<i>Inaba...</i>

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:31.380
I'm coming to your apartment tomorrow.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:33.820
<i>Bye.</i>

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:37.680
Hase's coming here?

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.130
Hase-kun's a great guy!

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:16.150
He's so cool and kind.

00:23:16.150 --> 00:23:17.510
I-Is he?

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:19.460
Does he have a girlfriend?

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:20.790
What's his type?

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:23.220
Do you think he's into older girls?

00:23:23.220 --> 00:23:24.960
Tell me! Tell me now!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:28.120
M-Mariko-san, you're very aggressive...

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:31.680
Next time on <i>Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</i>:

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:32.970
Bookmaster.

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:33.180
<b>Eighth Haunting 
Bookmaster</b>

00:23:34.020 --> 00:23:36.090
Furuhonya-san is actually...
